@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Noto Sans CJK SC
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam dpi 140
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam ArrowColor #35566C
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF5D6
skinparam NoteBorderColor #C9AD66
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam classBackgroundColor #EAF3FB
skinparam classBorderColor #496C84
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #EAF3FB
skinparam activityBorderColor #496C84
skinparam usecaseBackgroundColor #EAF3FB
hide empty members
hide circle
title 热管理逻辑控制服务 — 外部环境 BDD
left to right direction
skinparam nodesep 70
skinparam ranksep 90
class "热管理逻辑控制服务" as SYS <<system>> {
 requestIn : ~ThermalRequestPort
 statusOut : ThermalStatusPort
 vehicleStateIn : ~VehicleStatePort
 sensorDataIn : ~SensorDataPort
 actuatorCommandOut : ActuatorCommandPort
 cabinEffectOut : CabinEffectPort
}
class "IVI中控交互系统" as IVI <<external role>> {
 requestOut : ThermalRequestPort
 statusIn : ~ThermalStatusPort
}
class "车载CAN通信网络" as CAN <<external role>> {
 requestIn : ~ThermalRequestPort
 requestOut : ThermalRequestPort
 statusIn : ~ThermalStatusPort
 statusOut : ThermalStatusPort
}
class "整车状态与电源管理系统" as VEHICLE <<external role>> {
 stateOut : VehicleStatePort
}
class "温度与环境信息提供服务" as SENSORS <<external role>> {
 dataOut : SensorDataPort
}
class "热量与空气调节执行服务" as ACTUATORS <<external role>> {
 commandIn : ~ActuatorCommandPort
}
class "乘员舱与前风窗环境" as CABIN_WINDSCREEN <<external role>> {
 effectIn : ~CabinEffectPort
}
IVI --> CAN : requestIVIToCAN\nThermalRequestInterface\nrequestOut → requestIn
CAN --> SYS : requestCANToSYS\nThermalRequestInterface\nrequestOut → requestIn
SYS --> CAN : statusSYSOutToCAN\nThermalStatusInterface\nstatusOut → statusIn
CAN --> IVI : statusCANToIVI\nThermalStatusInterface\nstatusOut → statusIn
VEHICLE --> SYS : vehicleStateToSYS\nVehicleStateInterface\nstateOut → vehicleStateIn
SENSORS --> SYS : sensorDataToSYS\nSensorDataInterface\ndataOut → sensorDataIn
SYS --> ACTUATORS : actuatorCommandsToHVAC\nActuatorCommandInterface\nactuatorCommandOut → commandIn
SYS --> CABIN_WINDSCREEN : cabinEffectsFromSYS\nCabinEffectInterface\ncabinEffectOut → effectIn
legend bottom left
端口特征（均保留原接口语义）
ThermalRequestPort:
heatingRequest:Boolean, autoModeRequest:Boolean
frontDefrostRequest:Boolean, frontDemistRequest:Boolean
targetTemperature:Real
ThermalStatusPort:
heatingActive:Boolean, autoModeActive:Boolean
frontDefrostActive:Boolean, frontDemistActive:Boolean
VehicleStatePort:
highVoltageAvailable:Boolean, vehicleFaultActive:Boolean
stateOfCharge:Real
SensorDataPort:
cabinTemperature:Real, ambientTemperature:Real
sunLoad:Real, heaterCoreInletTemperature:Real
ptcTemperature:Real
ActuatorCommandPort:
ptcEnable:Boolean, blowerCommand:Real
compressorRequest:Boolean, airDistributionMode:Real
recirculationRequest:Boolean
CabinEffectPort:
cabinHeatingEffect:Boolean, frontWindscreenDefrostEffect:Boolean
frontWindscreenDemistEffect:Boolean
----
~表示原模型共轭端口；箭头表示原interface connect的信息流向。
物理部署/供货归属不由本黑盒图裁定；不展开CAN内部转发。
endlegend

@enduml
